 B7, B9 if I had those tiles. I will discard W1 as it is a terminal tile and has the lowest chance of being claimed by other players.]\\nReason: [W1 is a terminal tile and has the lowest chance of being claimed by other players.]\\nAnswer: Play W1\"}"}
